   "description": "<p>A key that sticks, repeats, or refuses to type slows down every message and every task on your MacBook Air M4. Small faults, big frustration. iFixit BD makes typing feel right again. We check the keys for free, show you the price in writing, and fit a quality-tested keyboard we test key by key. Most keyboards are done the same day, with a service warranty you keep. Walk into any of our four Dhaka centers, or call ahead so we have your part ready.</p>",
