   "description": "<p>A MacBook Air M4 that runs slow, freezes, or will not start macOS steals hours from your day and patience from your evening. A fresh system fixes that. iFixit BD sets it right. We check the fault for free, back up your files where we can, and install a clean, current macOS that runs smooth and quick. Most installs are done the same day, with full support after. Walk into any of our four Dhaka centers, or call ahead to keep a bench ready.</p>",
