   "description": "<p>A spill on your MacBook Air M4 is a heart-stopping moment, and the clock starts the second it happens. Liquid spreads and eats away at the board, so fast help matters most. iFixit BD acts quickly. We check the damage for free, clean the board deep, and work to save every part we can. You get a written price before we start and a service warranty after. Bring it straight to any of our four Dhaka centers, or call ahead and come in fast.</p>",
